					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760190101,
					"content": "\"Proof of the Cognoscenti\"? Wait... Are you talking about what Paimon thinks you're talking about...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190102,
					"content": "Wh—Why are you crowding around?! We're discussing something super top-secret here — a clue about Reed Miller's \"Great Treasure\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190103,
						760190104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vieri"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190103,
					"content": "Fantastic! Count me in!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760190105,
					"content": "Hmm... fair point. In that case, let's team up! I've been struggling to scrape together enough startup money anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vieri"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190106,
					"content": "One share for me, one for you... and one for the flying one. That's three shares. 500,000 Mora each.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vieri"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190107,
					"content": "500,000 Mora!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190108,
					"content": "*sigh* Vieri, didn't we agree this was supposed to stay between the two of us? I only told you because I trust you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190109,
					"content": "But 1,500,000 Mora... That's way beyond the sort of startup money I could raise on my own. I can just about scrape together 500,000...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vieri"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190110,
					"content": "And these two look like seasoned adventurers. If we team up, won't our chances of success go way up?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vieri"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190111,
					"content": "I have high hopes for you, Vieri. And if you think you've found the right people, then I'm willing to give you a shot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190112,
					"content": "Now, as for our flying friend here — given her... unique physique, it's only fair she receives special consideration.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190113,
					"content": "Ooh! Is that a gift for Paimon?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190114,
					"content": "Sort of! It's a special version of Natlan's standard Strength Tonic. We tweaked it so it works for more people — even people who fly. It's totally safe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190115,
					"content": "As for the price... Normally, it goes for 2,000,000 Mora. But since you're with Vieri, I'll give you the friends' rate — just 1,000,000. What do you say?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190116,
					"content": "1,000,000 Mora!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190117,
						760190119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190117,
					"content": "It's a special surprise gift, Paimon!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760190118,
					"content": "More like a special surprise heart attack!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190121,
					"content": "Exactly! Miss Hidimbi, I don't expect the flying one to be of much use anyway. It would be silly to waste the Strength Tonic on her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vieri"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190122,
					"content": "Hey! Just what are you trying to say about Paimon!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190123,
					"content": "Hmph, all we wanted was to see if you had any good clues for finding treasure, but look at you two! One's shady, the other's just dumb!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190124,
					"content": "#If you think you can trick the great adventurers, {NICKNAME} and Paimon, you'd better think again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190125,
					"content": "Shady? Trick you? I assure you this clue's entirely genuine, and so is the tonic. As for the price... that's just business. But as for you, little loudmouth...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190126,
					"content": "...You're exactly the sort of person I can't stand dealing with — loud, full of yourself, all bark and no bite, riding on someone else's coattails like you're a big deal yourself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190127,
					"content": "M—Miss Hidimbi...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vieri"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190128,
					"content": "And you, Vieri. Didn't we agree this was supposed to stay between us? When something's meant to be secret, you lean in close and whisper — not shout for the whole world to hear and attract unwanted company.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190129,
					"content": "You've put me in a foul mood now, and I won't feel any better until I've taught you a lesson!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190130,
					"content": "Take this!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Hidimbi"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190119,
					"content": "500,000. Not a Mora more. Shake now, or we walk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760190120,
					"content": "Why are you bargaining?! We don't even need this thing!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760190104,
					"content": "If somebody overhears it, it's not really a secret.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760190105
					]
				}
			]
		},
